{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"gongsuntao-e-o176","title":"郡守张磐亲谦谦耻屈以舞构隙","accounts":[{"id":"gongsuntao-a-5fdd21162cef7c253240","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"郡守张磐亲谦谦耻屈以舞构隙","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b9a6c2fae77a5eee3de2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"gongsuntao-p0037","role":"郡守、同郡先辈、与谦父友意殊亲之、常私还入与谦饮宴、尝以舞属谦、曰不当转邪","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b9a6c2fae77a5eee3de2"]},{"person":"wudi-p0095","role":"耻为之屈、不为起、固强之乃舞又不转、曰不可转转则胜人、由是不乐卒以构隙","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b9a6c2fae77a5eee3de2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b9a6c2fae77a5eee3de2"]},"ordering_evidence":"gongsuntao-q-b9a6c2fae77a5eee3de2","source_order":[8,138,33],"order":1986}],"persons":[{"id":"gongsuntao-p0037","name":"张磐","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b9a6c2fae77a5eee3de2"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-b9a6c2fae77a5eee3de2","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-e3bc0b38fe9a815adca5","layer":"pei","quote":"郡守张磐，同郡先辈，与谦父友，意殊亲之；而谦耻为之屈。与众还城，因以公事进见；坐罢，磐常私还入，与谦饮宴，或拒不为留。尝以舞属谦，谦不为起；固强之，（及）〔乃〕舞，又不转。磐曰：‘不当转邪？’曰：‘不可转，转则胜人！’由是不乐，卒以构隙","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ce856e1cbc0cbd5e777b","start":33,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
